{"seq":2,"slug":"deadlock-livelock-starvation","title":"死锁、活锁与饥饿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/deadlock-livelock-starvation","wordCount":1150,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"死锁-活锁与饥饿\">死锁、活锁与饥饿</h1><h2 id=\"问题描述\">问题描述</h2><p>在并发系统中，多个线程竞争有限资源时，可能出现三种典型的活性问题（Liveness Issues）：<strong>死锁（Deadlock）</strong>、<strong>活锁（Livelock）</strong> 和 <strong>饥饿（Starvation）</strong>。这三者都会导致线程无法正常推进工作，但其成因和表现形式各不相同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    ROOT[&quot;Concurrency Liveness Issues&quot;] --&gt; DL[&quot;💀 Deadlock&lt;br/&gt;All threads wait for each other&lt;br/&gt;All stuck&quot;]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; LL[&quot;🔄 Livelock&lt;br/&gt;Threads keep responding&lt;br/&gt;But make no real progress&quot;]&#10;    ROOT --&gt; ST[&quot;😢 Starvation&lt;br/&gt;Some threads&lt;br/&gt;never get resources&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    ROOT[\"Concurrency Liveness Issues\"] --&gt; DL[\"💀 Deadlock&lt;br/&gt;All threads wait for each other&lt;br/&gt;All stuck\"]\n    ROOT --&gt; LL[\"🔄 Livelock&lt;br/&gt;Threads keep responding&lt;br/&gt;But make no real progress\"]\n    ROOT --&gt; ST[\"😢 Starvation&lt;br/&gt;Some threads&lt;br/&gt;never get resources\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"死锁-deadlock\">死锁（Deadlock）</h3><p>死锁是指两个或多个线程互相持有对方需要的资源，同时又在等待对方释放资源，导致所有线程都无法继续执行的状态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    TA[&quot;Thread A&lt;br/&gt;Holds: Lock 1&lt;br/&gt;Waits: Lock 2&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Waiting&quot;| TB[&quot;Thread B&lt;br/&gt;Holds: Lock 2&lt;br/&gt;Waits: Lock 1&quot;]&#10;    TB --&gt;|&quot;Waiting&quot;| TA\">flowchart LR\n    TA[\"Thread A&lt;br/&gt;Holds: Lock 1&lt;br/&gt;Waits: Lock 2\"] --&gt;|\"Waiting\"| TB[\"Thread B&lt;br/&gt;Holds: Lock 2&lt;br/&gt;Waits: Lock 1\"]\n    TB --&gt;|\"Waiting\"| TA</pre><p>死锁的发生需要<strong>同时满足</strong>以下四个必要条件（Coffman 条件）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">条件</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n<th align=\"left\">示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>互斥（Mutual Exclusion）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">资源一次只能被一个线程占用</td>\n<td align=\"left\">一把锁同时只能一个线程持有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>持有并等待（Hold and Wait）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">线程持有至少一个资源，同时等待获取其他资源</td>\n<td align=\"left\">持有锁 1，等待锁 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>不可剥夺（No Preemption）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">资源只能由持有者主动释放，不能被强制回收</td>\n<td align=\"left\">不能强制让线程释放锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>循环等待（Circular Wait）</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">存在线程的循环等待链</td>\n<td align=\"left\">A 等 B，B 等 C，C 等 A</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p>破坏其中任何一个条件，就可以避免死锁。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 死锁示例&#10;线程A:&#10;    获取锁(锁1)         // ✅ 成功获取&#10;    // ... 执行一些操作 ...&#10;    获取锁(锁2)         // ❌ 阻塞！锁2被线程B持有&#10;&#10;线程B:&#10;    获取锁(锁2)         // ✅ 成功获取&#10;    // ... 执行一些操作 ...&#10;    获取锁(锁1)         // ❌ 阻塞！锁1被线程A持有&#10;&#10;// 两个线程永远互相等待 → 死锁\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 死锁示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程A:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁1)         // ✅ 成功获取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ... 执行一些操作 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁2)         // ❌ 阻塞！锁2被线程B持有</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程B:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁2)         // ✅ 成功获取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // ... 执行一些操作 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁1)         // ❌ 阻塞！锁1被线程A持有</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 两个线程永远互相等待 → 死锁</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"活锁-livelock\">活锁（Livelock）</h3><p>活锁与死锁类似，线程也无法推进工作，但区别在于：<strong>活锁中的线程并没有阻塞，而是在持续地&quot;做事&quot;——只是做的事情没有意义</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant A as Thread A&#10;    participant B as Thread B&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;A: Acquire Lock 1&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: Acquire Lock 2&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;A: Try to acquire Lock 2 → Failed&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: Try to acquire Lock 1 → Failed&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;A: Yield: Release Lock 1&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: Yield: Release Lock 2&#10;    Note over A,B: Brief wait...&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;A: Acquire Lock 1&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: Acquire Lock 2&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;A: Try to acquire Lock 2 → Failed again&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: Try to acquire Lock 1 → Failed again&#10;    Note over A,B: Repeats indefinitely... 🔄\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as Thread A\n    participant B as Thread B\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;A: Acquire Lock 1\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: Acquire Lock 2\n    A-&gt;&gt;A: Try to acquire Lock 2 → Failed\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: Try to acquire Lock 1 → Failed\n    A-&gt;&gt;A: Yield: Release Lock 1\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: Yield: Release Lock 2\n    Note over A,B: Brief wait...\n    A-&gt;&gt;A: Acquire Lock 1\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: Acquire Lock 2\n    A-&gt;&gt;A: Try to acquire Lock 2 → Failed again\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: Try to acquire Lock 1 → Failed again\n    Note over A,B: Repeats indefinitely... 🔄</pre><p>活锁的经典比喻：两个人在窄走廊相遇，都想给对方让路，结果两人同时向左、又同时向右，谁也过不去。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 活锁示例&#10;线程A:&#10;    循环:&#10;        获取锁(锁1)&#10;        如果 尝试获取锁(锁2) 失败:&#10;            释放锁(锁1)        // &quot;礼让&quot;&#10;            随机等待一小段时间&#10;            继续循环             // 重试&#10;&#10;线程B:&#10;    循环:&#10;        获取锁(锁2)&#10;        如果 尝试获取锁(锁1) 失败:&#10;            释放锁(锁2)        // &quot;礼让&quot;&#10;            随机等待一小段时间&#10;            继续循环             // 重试&#10;&#10;// 如果两个线程总是同步重试，就会陷入活锁\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 活锁示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程A:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    循环:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        获取锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        如果 尝试获取锁(锁2) 失败:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            释放锁(锁1)        // \"礼让\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            随机等待一小段时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            继续循环             // 重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程B:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    循环:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        获取锁(锁2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        如果 尝试获取锁(锁1) 失败:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            释放锁(锁2)        // \"礼让\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            随机等待一小段时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            继续循环             // 重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 如果两个线程总是同步重试，就会陷入活锁</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"饥饿-starvation\">饥饿（Starvation）</h3><p>饥饿是指某个线程因为优先级低或调度不公平，始终无法获得所需资源，导致长期甚至永久无法执行。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    RES[&quot;🔒 Shared Resource&quot;] --&gt; H1[&quot;High-Priority Thread 1 ✅&quot;]&#10;    RES --&gt; H2[&quot;High-Priority Thread 2 ✅&quot;]&#10;    RES --&gt; H3[&quot;High-Priority Thread 3 ✅&quot;]&#10;    RES -.-&gt;|&quot;Never gets a turn&quot;| LOW[&quot;Low-Priority Thread ❌&lt;br/&gt;Starvation!&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    RES[\"🔒 Shared Resource\"] --&gt; H1[\"High-Priority Thread 1 ✅\"]\n    RES --&gt; H2[\"High-Priority Thread 2 ✅\"]\n    RES --&gt; H3[\"High-Priority Thread 3 ✅\"]\n    RES -.-&gt;|\"Never gets a turn\"| LOW[\"Low-Priority Thread ❌&lt;br/&gt;Starvation!\"]</pre><p>饥饿的常见原因：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">原因</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>优先级调度不公平</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">高优先级线程不断抢占，低优先级线程永远无法执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>非公平锁</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">新到达的线程直接抢锁，排队等待的线程被忽略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>贪婪线程</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">某线程长时间持有资源不释放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>写者优先的读写锁</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">持续有写者时，读者永远无法获取读锁</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"典型场景\">典型场景</h2><h3 id=\"三者对比\">三者对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">特征</th>\n<th align=\"left\">死锁</th>\n<th align=\"left\">活锁</th>\n<th align=\"left\">饥饿</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>线程状态</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">阻塞（完全卡住）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">运行（但无意义）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">就绪（但得不到执行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>CPU 使用</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">不消耗 CPU</td>\n<td align=\"left\">消耗 CPU（空转）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">不消耗 CPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>涉及线程</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">两个或多个</td>\n<td align=\"left\">两个或多个</td>\n<td align=\"left\">一个或多个</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>检测难度</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">较易（可检测等待图）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">较难（线程表面活跃）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>恢复方式</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">终止线程或回滚</td>\n<td align=\"left\">引入随机退避</td>\n<td align=\"left\">公平调度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"经典场景-哲学家就餐问题\">经典场景：哲学家就餐问题</h3><p>五位哲学家围坐圆桌，每人需要同时拿起左右两根筷子才能吃饭。这个经典问题可以同时展示死锁和饥饿。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    P1[&quot;🧑‍🏫 Philosopher 1&quot;] --- C1[&quot;🥢 Chopstick 1&quot;]&#10;    C1 --- P2[&quot;🧑‍🏫 Philosopher 2&quot;]&#10;    P2 --- C2[&quot;🥢 Chopstick 2&quot;]&#10;    C2 --- P3[&quot;🧑‍🏫 Philosopher 3&quot;]&#10;    P3 --- C3[&quot;🥢 Chopstick 3&quot;]&#10;    C3 --- P4[&quot;🧑‍🏫 Philosopher 4&quot;]&#10;    P4 --- C4[&quot;🥢 Chopstick 4&quot;]&#10;    C4 --- P5[&quot;🧑‍🏫 Philosopher 5&quot;]&#10;    P5 --- C5[&quot;🥢 Chopstick 5&quot;]&#10;    C5 --- P1\">flowchart TD\n    P1[\"🧑‍🏫 Philosopher 1\"] --- C1[\"🥢 Chopstick 1\"]\n    C1 --- P2[\"🧑‍🏫 Philosopher 2\"]\n    P2 --- C2[\"🥢 Chopstick 2\"]\n    C2 --- P3[\"🧑‍🏫 Philosopher 3\"]\n    P3 --- C3[\"🥢 Chopstick 3\"]\n    C3 --- P4[\"🧑‍🏫 Philosopher 4\"]\n    P4 --- C4[\"🥢 Chopstick 4\"]\n    C4 --- P5[\"🧑‍🏫 Philosopher 5\"]\n    P5 --- C5[\"🥢 Chopstick 5\"]\n    C5 --- P1</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 死锁场景：每人先拿左边筷子&#10;哲学家i:&#10;    循环:&#10;        思考()&#10;        拿起(左边筷子)     // 所有人同时拿起左边&#10;        拿起(右边筷子)     // 所有人都在等待右边 → 死锁！&#10;        吃饭()&#10;        放下(左边筷子)&#10;        放下(右边筷子)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 死锁场景：每人先拿左边筷子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>哲学家i:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    循环:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        思考()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        拿起(左边筷子)     // 所有人同时拿起左边</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        拿起(右边筷子)     // 所有人都在等待右边 → 死锁！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        吃饭()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        放下(左边筷子)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        放下(右边筷子)</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"解决方案\">解决方案</h2><h3 id=\"死锁的解决策略\">死锁的解决策略</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    DL[&quot;Deadlock Countermeasures&quot;] --&gt; PREVENT[&quot;Prevention&lt;br/&gt;Break one of the four necessary conditions&quot;]&#10;    DL --&gt; AVOID[&quot;Avoidance&lt;br/&gt;Dynamically check if safe&quot;]&#10;    DL --&gt; DETECT[&quot;Detection &amp; Recovery&lt;br/&gt;Allow occurrence, handle afterward&quot;]&#10;    PREVENT --&gt; P1[&quot;Lock Ordering&lt;br/&gt;Break circular wait&quot;]&#10;    PREVENT --&gt; P2[&quot;Acquire All Locks at Once&lt;br/&gt;Break hold and wait&quot;]&#10;    PREVENT --&gt; P3[&quot;Timeout Mechanism&lt;br/&gt;Break no preemption&quot;]&#10;    AVOID --&gt; A1[&quot;Banker&#39;s Algorithm&lt;br/&gt;Only allocate safe resources&quot;]&#10;    DETECT --&gt; D1[&quot;Wait-for Graph Detection&lt;br/&gt;Periodically check for cycles&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    DL[\"Deadlock Countermeasures\"] --&gt; PREVENT[\"Prevention&lt;br/&gt;Break one of the four necessary conditions\"]\n    DL --&gt; AVOID[\"Avoidance&lt;br/&gt;Dynamically check if safe\"]\n    DL --&gt; DETECT[\"Detection &amp; Recovery&lt;br/&gt;Allow occurrence, handle afterward\"]\n    PREVENT --&gt; P1[\"Lock Ordering&lt;br/&gt;Break circular wait\"]\n    PREVENT --&gt; P2[\"Acquire All Locks at Once&lt;br/&gt;Break hold and wait\"]\n    PREVENT --&gt; P3[\"Timeout Mechanism&lt;br/&gt;Break no preemption\"]\n    AVOID --&gt; A1[\"Banker's Algorithm&lt;br/&gt;Only allocate safe resources\"]\n    DETECT --&gt; D1[\"Wait-for Graph Detection&lt;br/&gt;Periodically check for cycles\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">策略</th>\n<th align=\"left\">方法</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>锁排序</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">所有线程按相同顺序获取锁</td>\n<td align=\"left\">破坏循环等待条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>超时获取</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">获取锁时设定超时时间</td>\n<td align=\"left\">超时后释放已持有的锁并重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>一次性获取</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">一次获取所有需要的锁</td>\n<td align=\"left\">破坏持有并等待条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>银行家算法</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">分配前检查是否安全</td>\n<td align=\"left\">避免进入不安全状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 锁排序策略&#10;全局约定: 锁1 的编号 &lt; 锁2 的编号，总是先获取编号小的&#10;&#10;线程A:&#10;    获取锁(锁1)     // 先获取编号小的&#10;    获取锁(锁2)     // 再获取编号大的&#10;    // 安全执行&#10;    释放锁(锁2)&#10;    释放锁(锁1)&#10;&#10;线程B:&#10;    获取锁(锁1)     // 同样先获取编号小的（而非锁2）&#10;    获取锁(锁2)     // 再获取编号大的&#10;    // 安全执行&#10;    释放锁(锁2)&#10;    释放锁(锁1)&#10;&#10;// 不会出现循环等待 → 不会死锁\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 锁排序策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>全局约定: 锁1 的编号 &#x3C; 锁2 的编号，总是先获取编号小的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程A:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁1)     // 先获取编号小的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁2)     // 再获取编号大的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 安全执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(锁2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程B:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁1)     // 同样先获取编号小的（而非锁2）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    获取锁(锁2)     // 再获取编号大的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 安全执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(锁2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    释放锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 不会出现循环等待 → 不会死锁</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"活锁的解决策略\">活锁的解决策略</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 随机退避策略&#10;线程A:&#10;    循环:&#10;        获取锁(锁1)&#10;        如果 尝试获取锁(锁2) 失败:&#10;            释放锁(锁1)&#10;            等待(随机时间)     // 关键：随机化等待时间&#10;            继续循环&#10;&#10;// 随机等待时间使两个线程不再同步重试\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 随机退避策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>线程A:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    循环:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        获取锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        如果 尝试获取锁(锁2) 失败:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            释放锁(锁1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            等待(随机时间)     // 关键：随机化等待时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            继续循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 随机等待时间使两个线程不再同步重试</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"饥饿的解决策略\">饥饿的解决策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">策略</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>公平锁</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">按请求顺序分配锁，FIFO 保证先到先得</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>优先级老化</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">等待时间越长，优先级自动提升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>时间片轮转</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">每个线程分配固定时间片，轮流执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>资源配额</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">限制单个线程可持有的最大资源量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>死锁、活锁和饥饿是并发系统中三种典型的活性问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>死锁</strong>：线程互相持有对方需要的资源并等待，全部卡住。需要同时满足互斥、持有并等待、不可剥夺、循环等待四个条件。通过锁排序、超时获取或银行家算法预防和避免</li>\n<li><strong>活锁</strong>：线程不断响应但没有实质进展，CPU 空转。通过引入随机退避来打破同步重试的循环</li>\n<li><strong>饥饿</strong>：某些线程长期得不到资源。通过公平锁、优先级老化等机制保证调度公平性</li>\n<li>三者的共同点是线程无法正常推进工作；区别在于线程的状态和 CPU 消耗模式不同</li>\n<li>哲学家就餐问题是理解这三种问题的经典模型</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"死锁、活锁与饥饿","id":"死锁-活锁与饥饿"},{"level":2,"text":"问题描述","id":"问题描述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"死锁（Deadlock）","id":"死锁-deadlock"},{"level":3,"text":"活锁（Livelock）","id":"活锁-livelock"},{"level":3,"text":"饥饿（Starvation）","id":"饥饿-starvation"},{"level":2,"text":"典型场景","id":"典型场景"},{"level":3,"text":"三者对比","id":"三者对比"},{"level":3,"text":"经典场景：哲学家就餐问题","id":"经典场景-哲学家就餐问题"},{"level":2,"text":"解决方案","id":"解决方案"},{"level":3,"text":"死锁的解决策略","id":"死锁的解决策略"},{"level":3,"text":"活锁的解决策略","id":"活锁的解决策略"},{"level":3,"text":"饥饿的解决策略","id":"饥饿的解决策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"竞态条件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/race-conditions"},"next":{"title":"信号量与条件变量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/semaphores-and-conditions"}}